WEBVTT

01:31.000 --> 01:33.680
Ritual of offering begins!

01:33.760 --> 01:34.960
Ascend the Mountain

01:35.920 --> 01:37.160
and honor Leizu!

01:39.400 --> 01:41.920
In gratitude to Leizu,

01:42.000 --> 01:44.040
Xuanyuan's consort,

01:44.120 --> 01:46.120
the first silkworm mother

01:46.200 --> 01:48.320
who taught us to raise silkworms

01:48.400 --> 01:50.440
and make clothing.

01:50.520 --> 01:55.280
Her grace reaches all,
and her name immortalized.

01:59.200 --> 02:04.080
The Brocade Officer and Master
present silk and offer wine.

02:05.720 --> 02:07.080
As the year draws to a close,

02:07.920 --> 02:09.680
in gratitude to Leizu,

02:10.240 --> 02:12.360
I lead the esteemed householders

02:12.960 --> 02:14.520
to perform the purification ceremony,

02:14.600 --> 02:17.360
solemnly completing the ritual
at the altar,

02:17.440 --> 02:19.280
offering fragrant incense,

02:20.320 --> 02:22.040
praying for shared blessings,

02:22.760 --> 02:24.400
humbly inviting the deity to partake!

02:29.240 --> 02:32.640
The Brocade Officer and Master bow again!

02:34.080 --> 02:36.600
Everyone kneels in unison!

02:39.760 --> 02:43.400
Reverently honoring Leizu,

02:43.480 --> 02:48.000
praying for shared blessings!

02:48.080 --> 02:50.320
Pay your respects!

03:11.200 --> 03:12.320
Mr. Yang,

03:15.040 --> 03:15.880
where are you going?

03:17.160 --> 03:19.280
Why should I report my whereabouts to you?

03:21.600 --> 03:23.080
Once everyone finishes offering incense,

03:23.160 --> 03:24.960
we still need to escort the deity back

03:25.040 --> 03:26.560
and pay respects to Leizu.

03:26.640 --> 03:28.320
To avoid further delays on your part,

03:28.400 --> 03:31.080
please wait here with me.

03:32.360 --> 03:35.120
After all these years,
why are you still so tiresome?

03:36.720 --> 03:39.320
By the time they finish offering incense,
it'll be almost nightfall.

03:39.840 --> 03:42.360
I'm tired and just want to rest a bit.
What's wrong with that?

03:42.440 --> 03:44.280
What, did Leizu herself tell you

03:44.360 --> 03:46.200
that I must stand and wait?

03:48.360 --> 03:49.240
You…

03:49.320 --> 03:50.440
Gentleman,

03:50.520 --> 03:51.800
why not come and take a look over here?

03:51.880 --> 03:53.360
Try your luck for just 20 wen.

03:53.440 --> 03:55.560
- These are blessed by Leizu herself!
- Come and check out our fortune boxes!

03:55.640 --> 03:57.760
You might get something amazing.
Want to give it a try?

03:57.840 --> 03:59.360
These people attend the Leizu Festival

03:59.440 --> 04:00.840
just to pay their respects.

04:00.920 --> 04:02.920
Who'd want to buy this junky silk?

04:03.960 --> 04:05.880
And these boxes are downright ugly.

04:05.960 --> 04:07.920
We're offering a silk draw game here.

04:08.000 --> 04:08.880
Just 20 wen per draw.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.240
They're blessed by Leizu herself!

04:10.320 --> 04:12.760
- What's the matter?
- Where's the hype man we hired?

04:12.840 --> 04:13.960
He went to the restroom.
He'll be back in a bit.

04:17.720 --> 04:20.279
- How much did you agree to pay him?
- A whole string of coins.

04:20.360 --> 04:22.240
- Did you already pay him?
- Yeah.

04:22.320 --> 04:24.760
- Paid in full?
- Shouldn't we pay him in full?

04:24.840 --> 04:27.000
Why would he bother working now?

04:27.080 --> 04:28.800
He's clearly not coming back.

04:30.800 --> 04:33.280
I was fooled again, eh?
I'll just hire another one.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.680
You…

04:34.760 --> 04:36.480
Miss, may I ask,

04:36.560 --> 04:38.160
what do you mean
by "Leizu's blessing" here?

04:38.960 --> 04:40.960
And is it appropriate to sell silk

04:41.520 --> 04:42.360
at the Leizu Festival?

04:49.480 --> 04:51.040
Sir, you misunderstand.

04:51.120 --> 04:53.960
Leizu taught our ancestors
to raise silkworms and weave silk.

04:54.040 --> 04:55.640
Her contributions are immense.

04:55.720 --> 04:57.200
The fact that I can sell silk today

04:57.280 --> 05:01.240
is all thanks to her blessing,
and there is no disrespect intended.

05:02.960 --> 05:05.080
What we call "Leizu's blessing"

05:05.160 --> 05:06.520
is fortune hidden within these boxes.

05:06.600 --> 05:09.160
Inside,
you'll find silk of varying quality.

05:09.240 --> 05:11.600
Each box is priced at 20 wen.

05:12.200 --> 05:13.720
Feel free to choose one.

05:13.800 --> 05:17.360
Its quality depends entirely
on your luck today.

05:18.800 --> 05:20.160
I see now.

05:20.680 --> 05:21.800
Well, I'll…

05:22.720 --> 05:24.280
- give it a try now.
- Sure.

05:25.440 --> 05:26.280
Here.

05:28.240 --> 05:29.640
Which one would you like, sir?

05:30.240 --> 05:31.240
That one.

05:31.320 --> 05:32.560
- This one?
- All right.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.640
Sir, your fortune is truly abundant today!

05:38.720 --> 05:40.400
This is our lucky bonus,

05:40.480 --> 05:42.720
a blessing pouch
for double the good fortune!

05:42.800 --> 05:44.240
This pouch is exquisitely crafted.

05:44.320 --> 05:47.320
Even for 30 or 40 wen,
you wouldn't buy it elsewhere.

05:47.400 --> 05:49.280
Is everything inside good?

05:49.360 --> 05:51.280
It can't be. It's only 20 wen each.

05:51.360 --> 05:53.000
They'd lose a fortune.

05:54.080 --> 05:55.640
- Let me try another one.
- Sure thing.

05:55.720 --> 05:57.040
- This one?
- All right.

06:03.320 --> 06:06.200
- See? I knew it!
- It's a loss!

06:07.440 --> 06:08.400
This is old silk, isn't it?

06:09.280 --> 06:10.200
It's not worth 20 wen.

06:10.280 --> 06:11.520
It's not worth it at all.

06:11.600 --> 06:12.560
This isn't worth it!

06:13.480 --> 06:15.400
True, this one isn't worth 20 wen.

06:15.480 --> 06:17.800
But that pouch alone
is worth more than 20 wen.

06:17.880 --> 06:20.520
Together, you're still coming out ahead.

06:20.600 --> 06:21.840
That's true.

06:22.600 --> 06:24.240
- That makes sense.
- Exactly.

06:24.320 --> 06:26.480
If you put it that way,
I have to try another!

06:26.560 --> 06:27.800
Of course, go ahead.

06:29.200 --> 06:31.040
- That one.
- All right, that one.

06:31.120 --> 06:32.760
- That one. Yes.
- This one?

06:43.440 --> 06:45.080
Wow, that is great.

06:45.160 --> 06:46.000
Yeah.

06:46.920 --> 06:47.880
What's this?

06:47.960 --> 06:49.440
Midnight Purple Silk!

06:50.920 --> 06:52.760
Who knew these boxes held such fine silk?

06:52.840 --> 06:55.600
These fortune boxes are all about luck.

06:55.680 --> 06:57.480
- There's gain and there's loss.
- Exactly.

06:57.560 --> 07:00.680
As long as you buy enough,
the differences will even out eventually.

07:00.760 --> 07:02.880
Plus, even this old silk isn't useless.

07:02.960 --> 07:06.200
If you sell it to someone else,
you wouldn't lose much.

07:06.800 --> 07:07.960
If you win, you're happy.

07:08.040 --> 07:09.560
If you lose,
think of it as spending a few coins

07:09.640 --> 07:10.480
for some fun!

07:11.160 --> 07:12.560
Miss, you have a point!

07:12.640 --> 07:13.920
Here, I'll try one too!

07:14.000 --> 07:15.000
Sure.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.120
I'll try one too!

07:16.200 --> 07:17.120
Step right up!

07:17.200 --> 07:19.080
Don't push! Please don't push!

07:19.160 --> 07:20.600
- Line up for the mystery boxes!
- There's plenty for everyone!

07:20.680 --> 07:21.640
- Line up!
- Here!

07:21.720 --> 07:23.120
- Don't push!
- Here!

07:23.200 --> 07:24.800
Over here!

07:24.880 --> 07:26.520
I'll try one too.

07:26.600 --> 07:28.280
- I'll take this one.
- I'll try one as well.

07:28.360 --> 07:29.480
Yingying!

07:29.560 --> 07:30.840
There's enough for everyone!

07:30.920 --> 07:32.080
- Yingying!
- Yes.

07:32.160 --> 07:34.520
- Hurry, restock!
- Coming!

07:40.760 --> 07:42.800
This one.

07:42.880 --> 07:45.840
Miss, someone asked me
to send this to you.

07:45.920 --> 07:47.080
Thank you.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.520
Miss Ji,

07:55.600 --> 07:57.640
rushing over won't help your brother.

07:57.720 --> 07:59.040
Save your energy.

08:00.760 --> 08:02.120
You were the one who sent me the message?

08:02.200 --> 08:03.920
I took you in out of kindness,
gave you work at our house.

08:04.000 --> 08:06.760
Instead of gratitude, you stole our loom.

08:06.840 --> 08:07.880
Now you've been caught red-handed.

08:07.960 --> 08:08.840
What else do you have to say for yourself?

08:08.920 --> 08:10.600
There must be misunderstanding here!

08:10.680 --> 08:13.280
Mr. Wang, didn't you agree
to sell me this loom?

08:13.360 --> 08:14.960
When did I ever agree to sell it to you?

08:15.040 --> 08:16.240
- How could you even afford it?
- I…

08:16.760 --> 08:18.680
This loom was clearly stolen
from my house!

08:19.280 --> 08:20.680
- So many witnesses saw it happen.
- That's right!

08:20.760 --> 08:22.400
- Are you still trying to deny it?
- It was you!

08:22.480 --> 08:24.240
What did you do to my brother?

08:25.400 --> 08:29.000
Your brother depends on others for scraps,
enduring humiliation to work.

08:29.080 --> 08:31.960
I bet you don't know about any of this.

08:32.039 --> 08:34.159
My brother working for you
was all part of your plan?

08:35.440 --> 08:37.240
Just a little icing on the cake.

08:38.120 --> 08:40.280
A gentleman doesn't steal.
A virtuous man doesn't rob.

08:40.360 --> 08:42.400
I, Ji Yaoting,
have never resorted to petty theft!

08:42.480 --> 08:44.280
Where's the contract? Yes, the contract.

08:44.360 --> 08:46.440
Everyone here witnessed it that day.
We signed a contract!

08:46.520 --> 08:47.680
What contract?

08:48.240 --> 08:49.920
- Did anyone see it? Did you see it?
- No, I didn't.

08:50.000 --> 08:51.520
All we saw was Ji Yaoting

08:51.600 --> 08:53.120
stealing the loom
and getting caught red-handed.

08:53.200 --> 08:54.280
- That's right.
- You…

08:55.920 --> 08:57.240
The contract is with you, isn't it?

08:58.160 --> 09:00.120
Without that contract,

09:00.200 --> 09:03.600
your brother will be taken to the bureau,
have his hands and feet broken,

09:03.680 --> 09:06.200
and never weave brocade again.

09:09.320 --> 09:11.920
You're forcing my brother
into a dead end today.

09:12.000 --> 09:14.040
Aren't you afraid that one day,
I'll repay you in kind?

09:14.720 --> 09:16.960
A powerless criminal's daughter,

09:17.040 --> 09:18.760
and you dare challenge me?

09:18.840 --> 09:20.520
You're overestimating yourself.

09:20.600 --> 09:22.920
Fine, Mrs. Hua, just you wait.
Let's see if I can do.

09:24.120 --> 09:25.960
So, do you still want this contract?

09:27.320 --> 09:28.600
- Move the loom out!
- Don't move it!

09:28.680 --> 09:29.960
- Move it!
- Don't move it!

09:30.040 --> 09:31.120
- Move it!
- You agreed to sell it to me!

09:31.200 --> 09:32.440
- It's my loom!
- Move it!

09:32.520 --> 09:34.040
- Don't move it!
- You stole it from me!

09:34.120 --> 09:35.640
- Don't move it!
- This isn't your loom!

09:35.720 --> 09:37.200
- Quickly!
- Don't move it!

09:38.320 --> 09:40.960
Say it then. What do you want me to do?

10:06.880 --> 10:07.920
Let go…

10:09.680 --> 10:10.960
Why are you here?

10:11.040 --> 10:12.240
I came to find you.

10:12.320 --> 10:14.520
If you don't go back soon,
the situation above will be exposed.

10:14.600 --> 10:17.000
It's just a closing ceremony.
Must I really be there?

10:17.080 --> 10:19.360
What's your mouth for?
Can't you just make up an excuse for me?

10:20.040 --> 10:22.360
Excuses are easy to find,
but traces are hard to hide.

10:22.440 --> 10:24.400
If you miss the ceremony above

10:24.480 --> 10:27.080
and happen to stir up trouble
here in the mountains…

10:27.760 --> 10:29.600
This Brocade Officer position of yours

10:29.680 --> 10:31.280
is already under close watch.

10:31.360 --> 10:32.680
It's too easy to arouse suspicion.

10:32.760 --> 10:34.560
Where do all these coincidences come from?

10:35.560 --> 10:38.120
Caution and preparation prevent accidents.

10:38.200 --> 10:39.720
Bookworm!

10:40.760 --> 10:41.840
Brute!

10:42.760 --> 10:44.520
Come! Hand the money over to me!

10:44.600 --> 10:46.400
Let me weigh how much it is.

10:46.480 --> 10:50.800
- I knew Yingying's idea would work!
- Nice! My hand is the scale!

10:50.880 --> 10:52.120
Why don't you count it when you get back?

10:52.200 --> 10:54.320
Can you ever finish counting money?

10:54.840 --> 10:56.240
Yingying, you're back!

10:56.320 --> 10:57.800
- Yingying!
- Hey. How about that?

10:59.760 --> 11:02.480
- Are all the boxes sold out?
- Of course!

11:02.560 --> 11:04.560
With your brains and our hands,

11:04.640 --> 11:06.560
what can't we accomplish?

11:06.640 --> 11:08.120
My eyes were strained nearly to blindness.

11:08.200 --> 11:10.680
Finally,
we can join the Splendor Showcase.

11:11.800 --> 11:13.800
Mr. Zhao Senior is here.
Hurry, go greet him.

11:15.880 --> 11:16.760
- Look!
- Go!

11:16.840 --> 11:17.720
How about this?

11:19.240 --> 11:20.600
I'd like

11:20.680 --> 11:23.680
to introduce someone to all of you,
a rising star in business.

11:24.320 --> 11:25.880
- Please, everyone, stay a moment.
- A rising star in business!

11:30.320 --> 11:33.000
This is Miss Ji of the Huanhua Dyehouse

11:33.080 --> 11:35.560
from Sandaoyan.

11:36.840 --> 11:38.360
She's young,

11:38.440 --> 11:41.480
but she's got plenty of ideas.

11:41.560 --> 11:45.320
If you ever get the chance,
please support her endeavors.

11:46.800 --> 11:49.000
If you personally speak for her,

11:49.520 --> 11:52.200
she must be an extraordinary talent.

11:52.800 --> 11:54.000
Rest assured!

11:54.080 --> 11:57.040
Since you've asked,
we'll certainly help her out!

11:58.640 --> 11:59.720
Thank you.

12:00.680 --> 12:03.560
Sir, the old silk is sold out.

12:03.640 --> 12:06.640
I'd like to remind you of your promise
to grant me one request.

12:07.320 --> 12:09.680
Speak freely, Miss Ji.

12:09.760 --> 12:11.440
Pay attention!

12:21.920 --> 12:23.920
Stop stalling!

12:24.000 --> 12:25.080
- Just say it already!
- Yingying!

12:25.160 --> 12:26.320
- Yingying!
- Say it!

12:26.400 --> 12:27.280
Go ahead.

12:32.600 --> 12:34.160
Please, sir,

12:35.040 --> 12:37.520
allow me to marry Zhao Xiuyuan soon.

12:38.120 --> 12:39.320
What?

12:42.680 --> 12:43.880
What?

12:43.960 --> 12:45.160
Is this what we agreed on?

12:45.760 --> 12:46.840
Did I misremember?

12:46.920 --> 12:48.000
Ji Yingying,

12:49.120 --> 12:50.440
what's wrong with you?

12:50.520 --> 12:53.920
The betrothal between Zhao Xiuyuan and me
was set when we were young.

12:54.680 --> 12:57.280
I know the Zhao family
needs a capable wife.

13:00.600 --> 13:01.760
Previously,

13:02.280 --> 13:04.880
I caused Sang Shisi to stir up trouble
at Huanhua Creek,

13:05.400 --> 13:07.560
forcing the Brocade Officer
to change the creekside rules.

13:08.080 --> 13:11.680
Now, relying on my own abilities,
I stand before you discussing business.

13:12.920 --> 13:14.840
Surely, this proves my worth.

13:16.160 --> 13:18.440
Please grant your approval, sir.

13:22.520 --> 13:23.680
So, I've been played, have I?

13:23.760 --> 13:25.880
You little lady…

13:26.600 --> 13:28.440
You're quite the little lady indeed.

13:28.960 --> 13:32.240
Mr. Zhao Senior gave you
the right to discuss business,

13:32.320 --> 13:35.200
and you're wasting it with nonsense!

13:48.240 --> 13:49.200
Grandpa,

13:50.240 --> 13:53.240
this matter is my idea.

13:57.800 --> 14:00.720
I've always admired Miss Ji,

14:01.440 --> 14:04.600
and I wanted to take this opportunity
to ask for her hand in marriage.

14:05.840 --> 14:07.240
I hope you'll approve.

14:10.600 --> 14:11.440
Fool.

14:12.640 --> 14:14.560
This Zhao Xiuyuan
is as clueless as they come,

14:15.440 --> 14:17.680
discussing personal matters in public.

14:20.600 --> 14:21.840
Sir,

14:23.240 --> 14:26.040
since this is
your family's private affair,

14:26.640 --> 14:27.560
we'll excuse ourselves now.

14:28.160 --> 14:29.760
I must apologize for the embarrassment

14:29.840 --> 14:31.360
we've caused you all.

14:31.440 --> 14:33.760
Not at all. We'll take our leave first.

14:43.280 --> 14:45.880
Miss Ji, as for what you mentioned,

14:46.560 --> 14:49.840
when the time is right,
everything will naturally fall into place.

15:02.200 --> 15:03.120
Let's go!

15:22.600 --> 15:24.080
Ji Yingying, stop right there!

15:35.640 --> 15:37.000
What do you take us for?

15:37.080 --> 15:38.560
Tools for your personal gain?

15:39.800 --> 15:41.920
Stepping stones
for your high-society marriage?

15:43.120 --> 15:45.400
Do you really intend
to run a business with us?

15:47.320 --> 15:48.160
Ji Yingying,

15:48.680 --> 15:51.040
were you lying to me from the start?

15:52.160 --> 15:53.480
You're just like them.

15:54.000 --> 15:55.920
You never saw me as a friend, did you?

15:56.000 --> 15:57.080
Could there

15:57.160 --> 15:59.560
be more to this story?

15:59.640 --> 16:02.400
Yeah, let's calm down
and hear Yingying's explanation.

16:02.480 --> 16:04.280
What's there left to explain?

16:04.800 --> 16:07.400
Our hearts are divided.
And our trust is long gone.

16:08.480 --> 16:10.320
We might as well call it quits.

16:11.720 --> 16:13.520
It's my fault. I've let you all down.

16:16.120 --> 16:17.960
Fine. Ji Yingying,

16:18.480 --> 16:20.320
I must have been blind to trust you.

16:21.720 --> 16:23.920
"Honorary President"? I quit!

16:31.960 --> 16:33.000
What are you standing here for? Let's go!

16:58.040 --> 17:00.880
Since I chose to support you,
that won't change.

17:00.960 --> 17:04.119
I believe
you can accomplish something with us.

17:04.200 --> 17:06.200
As long as everyone needs me,
I'll give it my all!

17:23.960 --> 17:26.280
You tell me drinking is harmful,
but look how much you've had yourself!

17:26.920 --> 17:29.440
I'm fine. Give me that.
I can handle my liquor…

17:29.520 --> 17:30.640
Yingying,

17:31.440 --> 17:33.320
I've heard a bit
about what happened today.

17:33.400 --> 17:35.240
You're not someone
who goes back on her word.

17:35.320 --> 17:36.360
What's really going on?

17:38.440 --> 17:40.120
I heard

17:40.200 --> 17:43.560
you set up a stall to sell silk
at the Lei Zu Festival today

17:43.640 --> 17:45.200
to ask a favor of Mr. Zhao Senior.

17:45.800 --> 17:47.360
Did you hope to gain his approval

17:47.960 --> 17:50.040
for your marriage to Zhao Xiuyuan?

17:51.640 --> 17:54.000
Are you asking me to reveal this publicly?

17:54.600 --> 17:57.960
If you're offering yourself,
at least show some real capability.

17:58.480 --> 17:59.320
Oh, by the way,

17:59.920 --> 18:01.440
the new rules at Huanhua Creek

18:01.520 --> 18:03.600
was your idea, wasn't it?

18:04.680 --> 18:07.560
Miss Ji, you could tell Mr. Zhao Senior

18:07.640 --> 18:09.360
about this accomplishment.

18:09.960 --> 18:12.720
Take the initiative
and confess my schemes,

18:13.280 --> 18:14.920
then I'll face rejection
from both the Zhao family

18:15.000 --> 18:16.640
and the other dyehouse owners.

18:16.720 --> 18:18.600
One contract, two demands…

18:19.200 --> 18:21.400
Your business practices
are truly unfair, aren't they?

18:23.120 --> 18:25.120
It all depends

18:25.200 --> 18:27.040
on how much you care about your brother.

18:27.760 --> 18:29.120
Mrs. Hua

18:29.200 --> 18:30.760
made you say those things,

18:30.840 --> 18:32.960
ruining your reputation as a woman,

18:33.040 --> 18:35.360
while shifting the blame
for Huanhua Creek's new rules onto you.

18:35.440 --> 18:37.960
Turning the dyehouse owners against you.

18:38.040 --> 18:39.280
That's truly malicious.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.840
Yu, I feel awful.

19:03.240 --> 19:04.920
Can't we just tell them the truth?

19:05.840 --> 19:07.720
My brother endured so much humiliation

19:08.480 --> 19:10.680
behind the scenes while working,

19:11.560 --> 19:13.640
yet he acted as if nothing happened.

19:14.240 --> 19:16.040
If not for helping me,

19:17.560 --> 19:20.120
he wouldn't have been set up by Mrs. Hua.

19:22.440 --> 19:25.520
If he knew I did all this for him,

19:26.040 --> 19:27.960
who knows how guilty he'd feel?

19:28.760 --> 19:29.920
With his attitude,

19:30.000 --> 19:33.360
he might even give up
weaving brocade entirely.

19:33.440 --> 19:34.880
He's your elder brother.

19:34.960 --> 19:37.960
It's not your place to shield him.
Failure is a lesson learned.

19:39.440 --> 19:43.200
In the end, Mrs. Hua's target is me,

19:46.440 --> 19:48.280
and he was dragged into this.

19:48.960 --> 19:51.200
It's my fault I let down everyone.

19:52.920 --> 19:55.960
That contract…
Do you think Mrs. Hua will give it to you?

19:56.960 --> 19:58.280
Just wait and see!

19:59.680 --> 20:01.160
Once I get past this hurdle,

20:01.680 --> 20:03.280
I'll make sure to get that contract back.

20:04.520 --> 20:05.720
You really don't give up, do you?

20:06.320 --> 20:07.480
Give up?

20:08.440 --> 20:10.440
Why should I give up?

20:10.960 --> 20:12.760
Those dyehouse tycoons
can act as they please

20:12.840 --> 20:14.520
and we deserve to be bullied?

20:15.480 --> 20:16.480
So what if they have power and influence?

20:16.560 --> 20:18.840
Does that give them the right
to harm others?

20:18.920 --> 20:21.520
We work ourselves to the bone
to make a living!

20:21.600 --> 20:22.880
Do we deserve to be wronged?

20:22.960 --> 20:25.440
This is the Ji Yingying I know!

20:28.160 --> 20:30.360
Yu, let me tell you…

20:33.480 --> 20:36.600
I will soon create a new dye color.

20:37.720 --> 20:38.720
When the time comes…

20:39.520 --> 20:42.600
- When the time comes, I'll…
- Let's talk about it then.

20:42.680 --> 20:44.320
I'll go make you some hangover soup.

20:44.880 --> 20:45.720
I…

20:48.960 --> 20:50.840
When the time comes, I'll show them…

20:58.480 --> 21:00.800
- How much did she drink?
- You're here.

21:01.440 --> 21:02.880
Are you looking for her? Or for me?

21:05.560 --> 21:08.680
Yu, I saw a wild horse!

21:09.920 --> 21:11.960
A wild horse… Quick, give me a hand!

21:14.840 --> 21:17.400
I came to find some wine
and also to find her.

21:17.920 --> 21:20.200
But seeing her like this,
completely drunk,

21:20.280 --> 21:21.400
she probably
doesn't even recognize anything now.

21:25.320 --> 21:26.920
Do you recognize this silk?

21:29.120 --> 21:33.080
In all of Shu, when it comes to silk,
if I claim second place…

21:33.160 --> 21:34.160
How modest of you.

21:34.240 --> 21:35.880
No one dares claim first place!

21:36.480 --> 21:37.720
I may have spoken too soon.

21:38.280 --> 21:40.360
If you claim first place,
then take a good look.

21:41.200 --> 21:42.880
What is this?

21:45.760 --> 21:46.800
Do you recognize it?

21:47.600 --> 21:48.600
I do.

21:49.200 --> 21:50.720
It's your hand!

21:50.800 --> 21:51.960
Idiot.

21:54.440 --> 21:55.560
In my opinion,

21:56.080 --> 21:58.280
your skill in identifying silk
is far from refined.

21:59.080 --> 22:01.400
But your ability to boast is top-notch.

22:01.480 --> 22:02.320
You just don't recognize it, do you?

22:03.000 --> 22:04.440
Nonsense!

22:04.520 --> 22:08.160
In all of Shu, when it comes to silk,
if I… claim…

22:11.240 --> 22:12.920
Take care.

22:14.600 --> 22:16.880
Is this all
because the Zhao family hasn't replied?

22:16.960 --> 22:19.720
Are you so desperate
to marry Zhao Xiuyuan?

22:20.240 --> 22:21.560
What do you know?

22:24.360 --> 22:25.960
You're the Brocade Officer…

22:26.040 --> 22:28.680
No matter what title I hold,
I would never marry her.

22:29.320 --> 22:30.240
What I mean is,

22:30.320 --> 22:32.480
you could help by recommending her
for the Splendor Showcase.

22:35.480 --> 22:36.880
She wants to marry into a powerful family

22:36.960 --> 22:38.600
and succeed in business at the same time.

22:39.120 --> 22:40.640
She surely knows how to enjoy life.

22:41.480 --> 22:42.480
But those who have passed on…

22:43.280 --> 22:45.200
Does she not care about them at all?

22:45.880 --> 22:47.160
Help if you can. If you can't, then leave.

22:50.160 --> 22:52.760
Boiled bean sprouts in broth
can help with a hangover.

22:53.600 --> 22:54.440
It's gentler than most remedies.

22:55.840 --> 22:57.640
This restaurant is mine.
I don't need your advice!

22:57.720 --> 22:59.080
I'll take this wine!

23:36.520 --> 23:37.440
You're back.

23:39.360 --> 23:41.040
Mr. Yang,
if you have any grievances against me,

23:41.560 --> 23:42.400
can you just say them directly?

23:43.680 --> 23:45.440
That day, I came to Yizhou with my people

23:45.960 --> 23:48.680
and enjoyed various entertainments

23:49.600 --> 23:50.440
in the courtyard.

23:50.520 --> 23:52.320
Everyone came to join me,

23:52.400 --> 23:55.560
except you, who stayed in your room.

23:55.640 --> 23:57.320
Why was that?

23:58.360 --> 23:59.600
I don't enjoy banquets,

24:00.240 --> 24:02.040
nor am I good at pleasing people.

24:02.920 --> 24:04.080
That's it.

24:04.160 --> 24:06.600
I'm here to get things done,
not to fool around.

24:06.680 --> 24:08.960
I don't need someone
who shares my ambition

24:09.040 --> 24:09.880
or tries to win my favor.

24:10.680 --> 24:11.920
What I need

24:12.000 --> 24:15.680
is a pair of eyes different from mine
to see Yizhou City.

24:15.760 --> 24:20.080
That's why I chose you.

24:20.160 --> 24:21.040
Fine.

24:26.360 --> 24:29.440
Then I'll speak bluntly.

24:30.240 --> 24:31.080
Go ahead.

24:31.160 --> 24:33.480
I understand that you've recently been
feuding with the Yang family on purpose

24:34.320 --> 24:36.680
to make others think
you're isolated and unsupported,

24:36.760 --> 24:39.000
making you appear approachable
for bribes and alliances.

24:39.080 --> 24:40.120
It's a clever way to bait them.

24:40.200 --> 24:42.200
But the Yang family,
as the Brocade Master,

24:42.280 --> 24:44.200
have been operating in Yizhou for decades.

24:44.280 --> 24:45.800
If you could cooperate with them,

24:45.880 --> 24:47.200
it would be greatly beneficial.

24:48.080 --> 24:50.400
Despite clashing during the day,

24:50.920 --> 24:52.080
with your extraordinary martial skills,

24:52.160 --> 24:53.640
why not meet them secretly at night?

24:58.560 --> 25:01.200
I do need someone who speaks plainly,

25:01.280 --> 25:02.680
but I never said

25:03.240 --> 25:06.200
I wouldn't hit the one who does.

25:10.800 --> 25:13.960
So, did you discover anything
in the mountains today?

25:19.960 --> 25:21.520
The road ahead is blocked.

25:21.600 --> 25:22.600
We might need to take another way.

25:22.680 --> 25:23.520
What happened?

25:23.600 --> 25:25.760
A few large stones are blocking the path.

25:25.840 --> 25:27.440
They must have rolled down
from the mountain

25:27.520 --> 25:28.920
after the recent rain.

25:29.000 --> 25:31.240
You all, follow me to find another route.

25:31.320 --> 25:33.440
You, stay here and keep watch.

25:34.000 --> 25:35.040
Let's go.

26:16.600 --> 26:17.800
What's this?

26:17.880 --> 26:20.440
Someone took advantage of the crowd
at the Lei Zu Festival

26:20.520 --> 26:22.640
to bypass inspections and transport silk
into the mountain's interior,

26:22.720 --> 26:24.360
two whole chests of it.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.240
Transporting silk to the mountains?

26:27.560 --> 26:30.520
- Could it be…
- There must be a hidden brocade workshop

26:30.600 --> 26:32.360
somewhere up there we don't know about.

26:33.320 --> 26:34.880
Weaving brocade in the mountains…

26:34.960 --> 26:37.960
This batch of brocade
must be hiding an even bigger secret.

26:38.040 --> 26:39.600
With such a large operation,

26:40.920 --> 26:42.440
could it be connected
to the military commissioner?

26:43.520 --> 26:44.520
Mu Hui?

26:46.360 --> 26:47.920
He's the highest-ranking official here.

26:48.000 --> 26:50.320
All of Shu is his personal treasure chest,

26:50.400 --> 26:53.000
and the governor is just his lackey
for collecting money.

26:53.080 --> 26:55.160
These brocade merchants
pay tributes annually.

26:55.240 --> 26:57.040
He can exploit them however he pleases.

26:57.120 --> 26:59.000
Why go to such lengths?

26:59.880 --> 27:00.880
True.

27:01.520 --> 27:03.480
Only those who can't embezzle openly

27:03.560 --> 27:04.960
would resort to such elaborate schemes,

27:05.040 --> 27:06.240
acting so secretively in the mountains.

27:06.320 --> 27:07.680
In that case,

27:08.200 --> 27:11.000
should we inform
the military commissioner in the future?

27:27.240 --> 27:28.120
Much appreciated.

27:29.240 --> 27:30.320
Please inspect the silk.

27:42.000 --> 27:44.240
Miss, it's getting late.

27:44.320 --> 27:47.040
It's cold in the mountains.
Let's head back early.

27:49.120 --> 27:50.960
Have you gathered any information?

27:51.040 --> 27:52.440
The letter says

27:52.520 --> 27:54.880
that Yang Jinglan has been at odds
with the Yang family since childhood.

27:54.960 --> 27:56.200
He later ran away from home

27:56.720 --> 27:58.400
and became a wandering swordsman,

27:58.480 --> 28:00.080
traveling from place to place.

28:00.640 --> 28:03.440
A year ago, he went to the capital
and purchased an official title.

28:05.640 --> 28:06.560
Bought his position?

28:08.560 --> 28:10.120
The Brocade Officers of Yizhou
kept dying mysteriously,

28:10.200 --> 28:11.040
and no one dared take the post.

28:11.120 --> 28:13.200
Since he's a Yizhou native

28:13.280 --> 28:14.640
and wanted this position

28:14.720 --> 28:15.920
to spite the Yang family,

28:16.000 --> 28:18.880
he paid someone to secure the role.

28:21.560 --> 28:24.520
Sounds like he's a complete playboy.

28:27.600 --> 28:28.880
Yet at Huanhua Creek,

28:28.960 --> 28:32.560
he was the only one bold enough
to post a notice

28:33.120 --> 28:34.960
banning territorial disputes.

28:37.000 --> 28:39.240
A playboy who wants to do a good job?

28:39.320 --> 28:42.600
Rumor has it Ji Yingying is behind it.

28:44.920 --> 28:47.720
Since we can't confirm his intentions,

28:48.240 --> 28:51.320
let's see what he's capable of.

28:53.720 --> 28:55.760
Go ask Mrs. Hua to do something.

28:57.560 --> 28:59.000
I'll use the Splendor Showcase

28:59.600 --> 29:01.520
to test the waters.

29:02.920 --> 29:03.760
Yes, ma'am.

29:14.240 --> 29:15.200
She's asleep?

29:16.120 --> 29:19.360
How about letting her rest here tonight?

29:20.000 --> 29:22.440
That won't do.
If Mother finds out, she'll be angry.

29:24.200 --> 29:26.440
Yingying gained Mr. Zhao Senior's approval

29:26.520 --> 29:27.960
and sold silk
at the Lei Zu Festival today.

29:28.480 --> 29:31.680
But from her sorrowful expression,
it doesn't look like she drank out of joy.

29:32.640 --> 29:33.720
Did something happen?

29:37.840 --> 29:40.480
Even if you knew, what could you do?

29:42.800 --> 29:44.120
Right.

29:45.560 --> 29:47.640
I can't even handle my own problems.

29:48.160 --> 29:50.800
I couldn't even protect Father's loom,

29:52.840 --> 29:54.560
let alone help her.

29:56.160 --> 29:58.160
Our family's had nothing
but misfortune lately.

29:58.800 --> 30:00.120
She must be overwhelmed with grief

30:00.200 --> 30:01.640
and so was drinking herself
into this state.

30:02.160 --> 30:03.480
It's my fault.

30:06.840 --> 30:09.120
I couldn't protect her.

30:09.200 --> 30:11.040
Stop crying.

30:11.640 --> 30:13.600
Yingying is much stronger than you think.

30:16.560 --> 30:19.080
What happened exactly?

30:19.840 --> 30:20.880
Please, Yuniang, tell me.

30:27.120 --> 30:30.720
DALIN DEEP SILK TRADING HOUSE

30:33.400 --> 30:36.240
You're a gentleman, a good person,

30:36.320 --> 30:37.960
But kindness without a sharp edge

30:38.480 --> 30:40.720
can't fend off the sharp swords
aimed at you.

30:41.240 --> 30:44.040
She didn't tell you
because she wanted to protect you.

30:45.640 --> 30:47.040
But the longer she shields you,

30:48.360 --> 30:50.520
the more guilt you'll feel
when you finally learn the truth.

31:05.120 --> 31:07.960
Two guests, this way.

31:18.880 --> 31:21.440
Hand it over. The contract
Mr. Wang tricked me into signing.

31:21.960 --> 31:23.920
Yingying has done her part.

31:24.440 --> 31:25.880
It's your turn to give up the contract.

31:25.960 --> 31:28.880
You think I'll just hand it over
because you asked?

31:30.320 --> 31:31.520
Unless…

31:32.320 --> 31:33.360
Mr. Ji,

31:33.440 --> 31:36.360
you kneel and kowtow to me three times,

31:36.440 --> 31:38.080
or pay 300 guan to redeem it.

31:38.160 --> 31:39.440
You're all liars!

31:40.120 --> 31:41.680
This is just who I am!

31:41.760 --> 31:43.600
I'm not one of those bookish gentlemen.

31:43.680 --> 31:45.400
If it weren't for your scheming,

31:45.480 --> 31:47.920
Yingying wouldn't have had
to ruin her reputation to save me!

31:50.920 --> 31:53.000
Did I ruin Ji Yingying's reputation?

31:53.080 --> 31:56.520
She's always hanging around those men.

31:56.600 --> 31:59.160
Everyone in Sandaoyan knows it.

31:59.240 --> 32:00.320
Does she even have a reputation?

32:02.040 --> 32:04.280
How dare you hit me!

32:04.360 --> 32:06.280
Ji Yaoting, I'll kill you!

32:06.360 --> 32:07.240
I'll kill you!

32:08.880 --> 32:10.080
If you bully Yingying again,

32:10.160 --> 32:12.240
I'll beat you every time I see you!

32:12.320 --> 32:16.040
You're a scholar.
How can you strike so hard…

32:16.120 --> 32:18.680
I read books
simply because I love reading.

32:19.200 --> 32:20.720
I'm no gentleman!

32:20.800 --> 32:22.200
I'm the eldest son of the Ji family,

32:22.280 --> 32:24.720
Yingying's elder brother!
Are you giving it up or not?

32:25.680 --> 32:27.600
I'll give it…

32:28.160 --> 32:29.320
Here…

32:38.080 --> 32:39.600
Hua Xiangrong, let me tell you…

32:40.200 --> 32:43.520
Scholars get more tricks up our sleeves.

32:55.880 --> 32:57.600
Forgive me…

32:58.240 --> 33:01.840
I acted impulsively
and caused you trouble.

33:01.920 --> 33:05.040
I'll compensate for any damages
to the items here later.

33:05.640 --> 33:07.120
I'll take my leave now.

33:09.040 --> 33:10.120
You…

33:12.160 --> 33:14.240
This bookworm… He dares to fight!

33:18.480 --> 33:19.520
Compensation!

33:49.560 --> 33:52.400
CONTRACT

33:54.400 --> 33:55.240
GUARANTOR: ZHANG WENYUAN, MA DATONG…

33:55.920 --> 33:59.240
PAWNER: WANG QUAN'AN OF JIN HOUSE, YIZHOU
NOW PAWNING A JACQUARD WEAVING LOOM…

34:52.760 --> 34:53.639
Yaoting, I'm hungry.

34:55.520 --> 34:57.520
I saved you some porridge.
I'll get it for you.

34:58.560 --> 35:00.800
Young Master. Miss.

35:03.240 --> 35:04.080
The madam has returned.

35:04.880 --> 35:07.200
She was invited back
by the second wife of the Zhao family.

35:08.840 --> 35:09.800
Let's go.

35:11.320 --> 35:13.040
This is this year's new tea.

35:13.560 --> 35:16.040
Though it's not expensive,
It's fresh and flavorful.

35:16.840 --> 35:18.520
Please have a taste, Madam.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.240
Let's get straight to the point.

35:21.320 --> 35:23.320
I invited you back

35:23.840 --> 35:27.120
to discuss the marriage
between Xiuyuan and Miss Ji.

35:28.760 --> 35:29.680
Madam,

35:29.760 --> 35:31.640
it seems we're on the same page.

35:31.720 --> 35:33.400
The marriage between them

35:33.480 --> 35:35.360
was arranged
while Yingying's father was still alive.

35:36.040 --> 35:39.000
At that time,
he had a particular fondness for Xiuyuan.

35:39.520 --> 35:42.280
- This marriage…
- This marriage, let's call it off.

35:45.080 --> 35:46.120
Call it off?

35:46.200 --> 35:48.920
How can it be canceled so lightly?

35:50.160 --> 35:53.120
Nothing in this world is unchanging.

35:54.200 --> 35:56.000
Take Brocade Master Ji for example.

35:56.080 --> 35:57.320
He was once so prominent,

35:57.920 --> 35:59.720
but later, his household fell into ruin,

36:00.520 --> 36:02.200
and your entire family
was dragged down with him.

36:06.040 --> 36:09.760
Xiuyuan is the legitimate son
of the Zhao family's second branch.

36:10.480 --> 36:12.600
Even if he doesn't become the family head
in the future,

36:12.680 --> 36:14.640
he will inherit a considerable fortune.

36:15.240 --> 36:17.240
With his brilliance and talent,

36:17.800 --> 36:21.400
he is more than suited to marry
into a family of senior officials.

36:25.800 --> 36:28.200
I understand.
Please see yourself out, Madam.

36:30.680 --> 36:34.040
Actually, Miss Ji
does have some admirable qualities.

36:34.560 --> 36:36.120
She's capable and competent.

36:37.040 --> 36:39.280
Why not find her

36:39.360 --> 36:41.160
a steady and obedient husband?

36:41.800 --> 36:44.160
Let Miss Ji make waves outside,

36:44.240 --> 36:47.040
while her husband stays home
to care for you.

36:47.120 --> 36:48.720
Wouldn't that be the best of both worlds?

36:50.120 --> 36:51.920
I happen to have
a few suitable matches in mind.

36:52.000 --> 36:53.360
If Yingying marries first,

36:53.880 --> 36:55.840
it would be the Ji family
breaking off the marriage,

36:56.360 --> 36:59.680
leaving the Zhao family free
of any accusations.

36:59.760 --> 37:02.560
All these years,
your family has been delaying the marriage

37:02.640 --> 37:04.240
for this reason.

37:04.840 --> 37:07.280
What's this? Has the esteemed Zhao family

37:07.360 --> 37:09.000
stopped caring about their reputation?

37:15.240 --> 37:16.720
Speaking of reputation,

37:17.440 --> 37:19.640
you might want to worry about your own.

37:20.440 --> 37:21.960
How impressive Miss Ji is,

37:22.040 --> 37:25.280
offending every major dyehouse
in Sandaoyan.

37:25.360 --> 37:28.720
Even dye suppliers
refuse to sell to her now.

37:29.680 --> 37:32.520
The girls are not like the boys.

37:33.240 --> 37:36.160
When discipline is required,
it must be enforced.

37:37.000 --> 37:39.520
Otherwise, those who know the situation
might say they're disobedient,

37:39.600 --> 37:41.000
and those who don't

37:41.760 --> 37:44.800
might think their mother,
coming from a lowly family,

37:44.880 --> 37:46.520
doesn't know how to raise them properly.

37:48.040 --> 37:50.400
It's true my mother
wasn't born into a noble family,

37:50.480 --> 37:52.520
but no matter how unrefined her ways,

37:52.600 --> 37:53.800
she knows to be kind to others

37:53.880 --> 37:56.080
and would never cause scenes
in others' homes.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.040
How dare you!

37:58.280 --> 37:59.240
Greetings, Aunt.

38:00.440 --> 38:02.880
Aunt, are you here today
on Mr. Zhao Senior's orders

38:02.960 --> 38:04.040
to cancel the engagement?

38:05.080 --> 38:06.120
If that's the case,

38:06.200 --> 38:09.240
Mother, tomorrow,
you should tell Matchmaker Wang

38:09.320 --> 38:10.880
that Mr. Zhao Senior looks down
on our Ji family

38:10.960 --> 38:11.800
and wishes to call off the engagement.

38:11.880 --> 38:14.080
Ask her to find me another match.

38:14.160 --> 38:15.840
Watch your tongue!

38:15.920 --> 38:17.520
Mr. Zhao Senior
has never said such a thing.

38:18.520 --> 38:20.280
Then it must be you acting on your own.

38:21.880 --> 38:23.640
Congratulations, Aunt,
for reaching such heights.

38:23.720 --> 38:25.400
You can now make decisions
on Mr. Zhao Senior's behalf.

38:25.480 --> 38:26.720
Ji Yingying,

38:27.240 --> 38:28.800
stop using Mr. Zhao Senior
as leverage against me.

38:30.640 --> 38:33.280
Since I brought up the engagement

38:33.360 --> 38:34.520
in front of everyone,

38:35.120 --> 38:36.440
the Zhao family

38:36.520 --> 38:39.000
must respond appropriately.

38:39.080 --> 38:40.240
"Go see her.

38:40.320 --> 38:42.000
Find out what exactly she wants

38:42.080 --> 38:43.600
and what she's capable of."

38:45.280 --> 38:47.400
That's most likely
what Mr. Zhao Senior intended, right?

38:49.600 --> 38:50.760
Wrong guess?

38:52.400 --> 38:54.880
Speculating about my elders is my fault.

38:54.960 --> 38:57.360
How about I return with you

38:57.440 --> 38:58.960
to apologize to Mr. Zhao Senior?

39:01.760 --> 39:04.480
After that disgraceful display
at the Lei Zu Festival,

39:05.000 --> 39:07.040
do you think Mr. Zhao Senior
will tolerate you?

39:07.760 --> 39:10.960
Ji Yingying,
regardless of Mr. Zhao Senior's opinion,

39:11.040 --> 39:13.240
you'll never marry into the Zhao family.

39:15.280 --> 39:16.800
I've already lost face.

39:17.320 --> 39:20.200
But if you continue
to disrespect my mother at our home,

39:20.280 --> 39:21.840
I won't mind dragging you down with me.

39:22.720 --> 39:25.960
Our Ji family is small and insignificant.
Losing face means nothing to us.

39:26.040 --> 39:27.160
But as for the Zhao family,

39:27.240 --> 39:28.560
if you lose face,

39:28.640 --> 39:30.920
Mr. Zhao Senior might expel you.

39:31.800 --> 39:32.720
How dare you!

39:32.800 --> 39:37.080
Madam, you know my abilities are limited,
but I always keep my word.

39:44.800 --> 39:45.880
Over here!

39:47.880 --> 39:49.480
Guo Kui, see the guest out!

39:54.960 --> 39:55.800
Mother…

39:55.880 --> 39:57.880
Mother, I'm sorry…

39:57.960 --> 40:00.480
- Mother, Yingying didn't mean to…
- All right, enough.

40:03.080 --> 40:04.320
Get up.

40:06.000 --> 40:06.960
What,

40:07.040 --> 40:09.240
do you both think I'm that unreasonable?

40:11.960 --> 40:13.600
The Zhao family has gone too far.

40:13.680 --> 40:15.040
A bit of a scolding won't hurt.

40:18.280 --> 40:19.400
But as for this marriage…

40:20.200 --> 40:22.280
She has no say in the matter.

40:23.400 --> 40:26.040
As long as I'm useful,
Mr. Zhao Senior will eventually agree.

40:27.840 --> 40:29.960
Zhao Xiuyuan truly is a good match,

40:30.480 --> 40:33.360
but with a family like the Zhaos,
all about profit,

40:33.440 --> 40:36.040
- even if you marry into their family…
- Zhao Xiuyuan is different

40:36.120 --> 40:37.720
from the others in the Zhao family.

40:37.800 --> 40:40.080
I'm marrying Zhao Xiuyuan,
not the Zhao family.

40:40.160 --> 40:42.400
Oh, why do you think so simply?

40:42.480 --> 40:43.680
But it's true!

40:47.120 --> 40:48.480
Don't be upset.

40:50.240 --> 40:54.320
ZHAO RESIDENCE

41:05.840 --> 41:06.880
Zhao Ping.

41:10.080 --> 41:11.360
Sir, any orders?

41:11.440 --> 41:13.120
Deliver this letter

41:13.880 --> 41:14.760
to the Ji family.

41:16.400 --> 41:17.560
The Master has decreed

41:18.320 --> 41:19.720
anyone who dares to sneak you out

41:19.800 --> 41:21.600
or send a message to the Ji family
on your behalf

41:21.680 --> 41:23.600
will have their legs broken
and be expelled.

41:26.800 --> 41:27.640
Sir,

41:27.720 --> 41:29.200
please don't make things difficult for me.

41:32.160 --> 41:34.200
Then pass on a message to my grandfather.

41:35.720 --> 41:38.120
My brocade is ready for embroidery.

41:39.400 --> 41:41.040
Have someone send the materials over.

41:42.680 --> 41:44.800
I don't want to delay
this year's Brocade Weaving Competition.

41:45.760 --> 41:47.200
Understood. I'll go right away.

41:56.120 --> 41:58.360
Whose son are you?

41:58.440 --> 42:00.040
It's so lively up front.

42:00.120 --> 42:01.480
Why are you sitting here alone?

42:05.520 --> 42:06.680
My name is Ji Yingying.

42:06.760 --> 42:08.720
I'm the daughter of Ji Guinan.

42:08.800 --> 42:11.560
I'm here with my father
to celebrate Mr. Zhao Senior's birthday.

42:14.840 --> 42:16.520
Whether it's lively at home

42:17.400 --> 42:18.400
has nothing to do with me.

42:18.480 --> 42:20.840
They don't care if I'm happy either.

42:22.720 --> 42:24.640
Being happy is simple enough.

42:24.720 --> 42:25.800
Come, I'll take you somewhere.

42:32.880 --> 42:34.760
You have a nice smile.

42:35.360 --> 42:36.280
You should smile more often.

42:38.240 --> 42:40.360
Everyone sees the world differently.

42:40.440 --> 42:42.680
My father sees it through the dyehouse,

42:42.760 --> 42:44.200
in all its vibrant colors.

42:44.280 --> 42:46.440
My brother sees it through books,

42:46.520 --> 42:47.960
in the span of history and eternity.

42:50.080 --> 42:51.640
You can see it through a kite.

42:51.720 --> 42:54.560
However far you want to see,
that's how far it will fly!
